      "Stir well and finish cooking the rice, adjusting with salt if necessary. Once cooking is complete, turn off the heat and stir in the butter and grated Grana Padano DOP, both cold from the fridge.",
      "Add a little more broth, just enough to achieve the right consistency, then mix everything together, shaking the pan to create the classic \\"wave\\". Plate your saffron risotto and garnish with the saffron pistils set aside!",
